  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Incident momentum, $p=\\frac{E}{c}$\r\n\r\nFor perfectly reflecting surface with normal incidence\r\n\r\n$\\Delta p=2 p=\\frac{2 \\mathrm{E}}{c} ; \\mathrm{F}=\\frac{\\Delta p}{\\Delta t}=\\frac{2 \\mathrm{E}}{c t}$",
